# identity/ssh/identities/none -- no-op SSH identity.
#
# Never linked: modules/identity.nix links ~/.ssh/identities/active only for a
# real identity, so with dotfiles.identity = "none" the Include directive in
# identity/ssh/config matches no file, and OpenSSH skips it.
# Side effects: none. No host-specific configuration is applied.
#
# Purpose: the ssh overlay for dotfiles.identity = "none", so every identity
# value has one overlay file. It is intentionally comment-only; no Host blocks
# or directives are set.
